questions.solution:
The enzyme nitrogenase is a Mo-Fe protein and catalyses the conversion of atmospheric $\mathrm{N}_2$ to $\mathrm{NH}_3$ as

\begin{aligned}
$\mathrm{N}_2+8$ e^{-}+8 $\mathrm{H}^{+}+$16 $\mathrm{ATP}$ \longrightarrow & 2 $\mathrm{NH}_3+\mathrm{H}_2$ \\
+ & 16 $\mathrm{ADP}+$16 $\mathrm{P}_{\mathrm{i}$}
\end{aligned}

Enzyme nitrogenase functions under anaerobic condition and the pigment leghaemoglobin protect it from oxygen.

